              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "heading"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 1. Où se cachent-ils dans le tableau périodique ?",
            "start": 240,
            "end": 293
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Prends ton tableau périodique. Regarde tout à gauche :",
            "start": 295,
            "end": 349
          },
          {
            "id": "p6",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* La toute première colonne (colonne 1), ce sont les *métaux alcalins* (comme le sodium).",
            "start": 350,
            "end": 439
          },
          {
            "id": "p7",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Juste à côté, **la colonne 2**, c'est notre famille du jour : **les métaux alcalino-terreux**.",
            "start": 440,
            "end": 536
          },
          {
            "id": "p8",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Cette famille comprend six éléments (du haut vers le bas) :",
            "start": 538,
            "end": 597
          },
          {
            "id": "p9",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. Le **Béryllium** (Be)",
            "start": 598,
            "end": 622
          },
          {
            "id": "p10",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. Le **Magnésium** (Mg)",
            "start": 623,
            "end": 647
          },
          {
            "id": "p11",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3. Le **Calcium** (Ca)",
            "start": 648,
            "end": 670
          },
          {
            "id": "p12",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "4. Le **Strontium** (Sr)",
            "start": 671,
            "end": 695
          },
          {
            "id": "p13",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "5. Le **Baryum** (Ba)",
            "start": 696,
            "end": 717
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "6. Le **Radium** (Ra) *(qui est radioactif ! C'est celui que Marie Curie a étudié).*",
            "start": 718,
            "end": 802
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The elements in Group 2 are accurately identified from Be to Ra in proper periodic order.",
          "errors": []
